---
import SiteLink from '../../components/SiteLink.astro';
import Layout from '../../layouts/VentureLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import AdvisoryWalkthrough from '../../components/AdvisoryWalkthrough.astro';
import VentureMap from '../../components/VentureMap.astro';
import {venture} from '../../data/venture';
---
<Layout section="journey" title="The Venture Launchpad journey" description="Startup advisory from ideation to execution: discovery, validation, business models, MVP planning, pilots and operating readiness."><PageHero slot="hero" eyebrow="VENTURE LAUNCHPAD / THE JOURNEY" title="Give every stage a question to answer." description="An advisory engagement can connect problem discovery, customer validation, business models, MVP planning, execution and early growth. Agree the right starting stage and scope for your venture." image="venture-studio" imageAlt="Conceptual entrepreneurship and venture-building illustration" />
<section class="container section"><AdvisoryWalkthrough/><VentureMap/><div class="section-heading" style="margin-top:48px"><div><p class="eyebrow">FROM IDEATION TO EXECUTION</p><h2>Explore the support at each stage.</h2></div><p>Advisory focus, working tools, potential deliverables and decision points. Engagements are tailored; not every venture needs every stage.</p></div><div class="module-stack">{venture.stages.map((s,i)=><details id={`stage-${i+1}`} class="fde-module" open={i===0}><summary><span class="module-index"><Icon name={s.icon}/></span><span><h2>{s.title}</h2><span class="module-summary">{s.summary}</span></span><Icon name="plus" /></summary><div class="module-details"><div class="two-grid"><div><h3>Advisory focus</h3><ul class="check-list">{s.topics.map(t=><li>{t}</li>)}</ul><h3>How we can work together</h3><ul class="check-list">{s.tools.map(t=><li>{t}</li>)}</ul></div><div class="readiness-card"><h3><Icon name="folder"/> Potential output</h3><p>{s.output}</p><h3 style="margin-top:24px">Decision criteria</h3><ul class="check-list">{s.criteria.map(t=><li>{t}</li>)}</ul></div></div><div class="lab-brief"><p class="eyebrow">EXAMPLE ENGAGEMENT ACTIVITY</p><p>{s.lab}</p></div><p>{s.work}</p><div class="module-question"><Icon name="message"/><p><strong>Review question:</strong> {s.question}</p></div></div></details>)}</div></section>
<section class="container section section-tight"><p class="eyebrow">ILLUSTRATIVE CLIENT JOURNEY</p><h2>From “an app for colleges” to one testable workflow.</h2><div class="three-grid">{[['Observe','A student team suspects laboratory equipment bookings are difficult. They interview students and lab coordinators before deciding what to build.'],['Experiment','A clickable booking flow tests whether users can find an available slot. A manually coordinated pilot tests demand before automation is added.'],['Learn','The team records completion rate, conflicts and coordinator effort. The decision is to refine, change the problem or stop—not to declare success because a prototype exists.']].map(([title,copy])=><article class="feature"><h3>{title}</h3><p>{copy}</p></article>)}</div><div class="actions"><SiteLink class="button" href="/venture-studio/submit/">Prepare your idea brief <Icon name="arrowRight" /></SiteLink></div></section></Layout>
<script>function revealStage(){const id=location.hash.slice(1);const el=document.getElementById(id);if(el instanceof HTMLDetailsElement)el.open=true;}revealStage();window.addEventListener('hashchange',revealStage);</script>
